  Liberation Sans, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1;
  the full text is in tests/XRay.Psd.Text.Tests/Fonts/LiberationSans-OFL.txt.

The tests also read fixtures that are not in this repository, from the psd/ folder of
https://github.com/curiosity-ai/test_documents, which carries their licenses:

